<title>BELGIUM: Belgian yr/yr inflation 1.98 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Belgian yr/yr inflation 1.98 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Economics Ministry released the following data on inflation on Thursday.</p>
<p>    BELGIAN CONSUMER PRICES     Feb	  Jan	  Feb 1996</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1988)	 124.50     124.65     121.84</p>
<p>    Mth/mth change (in pct)	-0.12	 0.69	 0.91</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (in pct)	  +1.98	 2.31	 1.96</p>
<p>The ministry said price rises were mainly seen for flowers and plants and rent, while for fresh vegetables, liquid fuel and fresh fruit lower prices were recorded.</p>
</text>
